From: sitish <sitishjayaswal12@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 15:09:30 +0545
Subject: [PATCH] context: logout hand-off: a user session's compositor sends
 "logout" on its hand-off socket; greetd starts the greeter on its VT without
 switching (ANDROMEDA_LOGIN_HANDOFF for the held frame), the greeter's
 compositor asks for the switch, and its ready retires the user session

---
 greetd/src/context.rs | 150 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++----------
 greetd/src/server.rs  |   5 ++
 2 files changed, 122 insertions(+), 33 deletions(-)

